+{
+"meta": {
+"source": "Horry County Register of Deeds, AcclaimWeb deed index (https://acclaimweb.horrycounty.org/AcclaimWeb/search/SearchTypeDocType), Doc Type DEED (001), record dates 10/1/2024 to 9/30/2026, pulled week by week on 2026-10-29 (105 weekly searches, 59,170 deeds; the 2025-10-01 to 2026-09-30 part is 30,339 deeds, the same total as batch 2026-10-b). Parcel attributes from Horry County GIS parcels, MapServer layer 24 (https://www.horrycounty.org/parcelapp/rest/services/HorryCountyGISApp/MapServer/24/query), read 2026-10-29.",
+"definition": "A flip here = the same parcel recorded on two priced deeds no more than 365 days apart (ATTOM's definition: two arm's-length sales of the same property within 12 months), where the second deed was recorded 2025-10-01 to 2026-09-30. The purchase is the deed just before the resale among the kept deeds.",
+"kept_deed_filter": "Consideration over $10,000; exactly one 11-digit parcel number; no 'DELINQUENT TAX', 'SHERIFF' or 'MASTER IN EQUITY' in a party name; no 'CORRECT' or 'RE-RECORD' in the memo; memo does not name several parcels, lots or tracts ('SEVERAL', 'PARCELS', 'TRACTS', 'LOTS', 'n UNITS'). 36,292 deeds of 59,170 kept.",
+"pair_exclusions": {
+"builder name on either deed": 153,
+"recorded the same day": 21,
+"not residential with a building": 317,
+"purchase at or under 1.25x county land value (likely lot, then new house)": 44,
+"not in county parcel layer": 2,
+"same name both sides": 1
