+"builder_pattern": "HORTON|LENNAR|\\bNVR\\b|PULTE|MERITAGE|CLAYTON PROPERTIES|GREAT SOUTHERN HOMES|BEVERLY HOMES|STARLIGHT HOMES|BEAZER|ASHTON CHARLESTON|TOLL SOUTHEAST|H & H CONSTRUCTORS|RS PARKER|DRB GROUP|DREAM FINDERS|HOWELL HOMES|MILLROSE|LEWIS CONSTRUCTION|CHRIS MANNING|CAROLINA COTTAGE|HUNTER QUINN|BRADLEY JONES|SANDS BUILDING|OCEAN PALMS BUILDERS|INFINITY CUSTOM|ALMOND QUALITY|AG EHC|KL LB BUY|BUILDERS?\\b|CONSTRUCTION|CONSTRUCTORS|HOMES (INC|LLC)|HOMES OF|HOME BUILDERS|DEVELOPMENT",
+"what_could_not_be_excluded": "(1) Non-arm's-length sales over $10,000 (relatives, related companies): the county does not flag them. (2) A lot sold to a small builder or owner whose name does not match the pattern, bought above 1.25 times land value: some may remain. (3) The county land use code meanings are not published; 1xx with a building value is read as residential. (4) Condo-style units have no separate land value (no_land_value true), so the lot test cannot apply to them. (5) The county building value is the current one, so a house built after the purchase looks like an existing house. (6) Prices are the clerk-typed consideration; dates are recording dates.",
+"not_profit": "gain = resale consideration minus purchase consideration. It is gross. It leaves out repairs, loan costs, taxes, insurance, utilities, both closings, the deed recording fee and commissions.",
